  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "structure",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -180,
      "w": 760,
      "text": "Same window, same bones as the reference: 1000×622, 158px sidebar, inset sheet with a 12px corner, document column of 535px — title, date, three tabs, read bar, body, ask input.\nWispr's sections mapped one-to-one onto NoteFish: Dictation→Desk, Notetaker→Calls, Insights, Dictionary→Glossary (words that stay as written), Snippets→Phrases (saved replies), Style→Voice (your clone + register), Transforms→Floor. Bottom: Invite your team, Settings, Help.\nName, mark, icons and type are NoteFish's own."
    },
    {
      "id": "avatar",
      "x": 2160,
      "y": 3380,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "Avatar: Puff. A fluffy circle of bumps with dot eyes and a small smile. Eight silhouettes (puff, cloud, sheep, bloom, tuft, pom, squish, pear), eleven colours. The face can be switched off for lists."
    },
    {
      "id": "companion",
      "x": 2160,
      "y": 660,
      "w": 460,
      "text": "The pill lives on the screen, not in the window. It appears when a call is detected in any app and asks before it starts. Hold ⌥ to speak; the caller hears your voice in their language."
    },
    {
      "id": "moments",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 4050,
      "w": 620,
      "text": "The moments the app has that the design never drew: the call ringing, the ticket while talking, the call ending, recording a take, taking a seat, and what the caller sees on their phone."
    }
  ],
  "launch": {
    "view": "canvas"
  }
